;   19: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=あびじごく, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   20: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=むけんじごく, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   21: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ついぜんくよう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   22: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ぜいたく, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   23: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ぼんのう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   24: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はら, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   25: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=こっき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   26: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=こっきしん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=5035, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=4620, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\たき火.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\たき火.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>This must be my second spring already.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's been almost 2 years since I left the everyday world and shut myself away here on <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="いとひめやま">Mount Itohime</STYLE>.<PG>
The <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="さんろう">mountain seclusion</STYLE>, a custom unique to this place, Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Arata settlement originally had a military character, with a strong sense of self-defense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that each and every one of them is strong, a person here is recognized as an adult only after going through this rite of passage, the mountain seclusion.<PG>
The mountain seclusion is imposed on girls only.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Men are biologically muscular, which makes them a sufficient fighting force.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But no matter how much a woman trains, she can rarely beat a man's physical strength.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why, through a year of mountain seclusion, they acquire skills that make them a fighting force without relying on muscle.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">My mom</STYLE>, too, went through this mountain seclusion and married <STYLE ID="4">my dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently there are hardly any prospective brides these days who can endure the mountain seclusion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's how strong <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s will was, and then I was born.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since I inherited the blood of a <STYLE ID="3">mom</STYLE> like that―not that I take the mountain seclusion lightly―I should be able to see it through too.<PG>
But there are also cases where the mountain seclusion is waived.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, the ones who fall under that are <STYLE ID="5">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because there's no point in the mountain seclusion for girls who are already a sufficient fighting force.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those sisters spent their whole childhood playing in the mountains, so you could say they'd been doing the mountain seclusion out of habit.<PG>
Either way, as long as I live in the Arata settlement, I'll go through the mountain seclusion too and help make it a stronger settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After <STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE> died, <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> became the Grand Witch, and she told me <STYLE ID="8">"There's no need to go that far. It's just a tradition now,"</STYLE> but―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神茜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I lost <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> in the incident 2 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was she killed by <STYLE ID="9">Natsumi's mom</STYLE>, or did she disappear of her own will?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if she was killed, it's not that I hold a grudge against <STYLE ID="9">Natsumi's mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I think I understand well enough how things came to that.<PG>
But why did <STYLE ID="3">my mom</STYLE> vanish, and why did <STYLE ID="9">Natsumi's mom</STYLE> break into <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE>'s house?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, the reason is still unknown.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪山.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I've kept up the mountain seclusion a year longer than usual.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I started it at 18, and I'll finish it on my 20th birthday this month.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> said that on the day I turn 20, she'd tell me something that might be a clue to it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\たき火.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Either way, the day I come down from the mountain is close.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In about 20 more days, I'll be told that fact.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My birthday is April 30, and today is, if I remember right... 
{PAUSE ""}
April 7.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tomorrow is the anniversary of <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why, when <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> only vanished, is it the <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・・">anniversary of her death</STYLE>?<PG>
In Motoki-cho, Mom vanished on April 8, but because of something that happened afterward, <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s death came to light.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I close my eyes like this in front of the fire and think of <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
2 years ago in Motoki-cho, she murdered <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi's dad</STYLE> by <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="は">flaying</STYLE> him, and then disappeared.<PG>
Apparently <STYLE ID="3">my mom</STYLE> used to be very timid and clingy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After she had me, that same <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> apparently worked hard to be strong as a mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But maybe <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> tried too hard to be strong for my sake.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "escapescape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\七海荘昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
When I was being bullied, <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="てい">put herself on the line</STYLE> to try to save me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Back then, <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was unwell after losing <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>, but she pushed herself for my sake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was really strong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that strength must have been the strength of someone pushing herself too hard.<PG>
Did the gap between her deep psyche and reality grow too wide, until it broke <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s mind?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even after we went back to Motoki-cho, her heart never healed, and through some mistake, <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> caused the <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="は">flaying</STYLE> incident.<PG>
That's right. It was some kind of mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> wanted to do something like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was the culprit, it must have been because she pushed herself too hard.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Right after I arrived at the Arata settlement, <STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was apparently a heart attack, and the funeral was held on short notice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But something strange happened.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When they dug up the earth of the graveyard clearing to bury <STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE>―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hey! There's a body buried here! It's still decomposing!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who is this? Nobody's died lately!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the kind of uproar that broke out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, let's go over there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE> and I were kept away from the graveyard clearing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE>, back from the graveyard clearing, handed me a grimy photo.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\写真茜美冬.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was an old photo of two little girls standing side by side.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I recognized this photo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the photo <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> had always kept so carefully.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
What <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> told me was that the body they'd found was <STYLE ID="3">my mom</STYLE>, without a doubt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Decomposition was advanced, but from the clothes, the build and the belongings, it had to be <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was also told she'd been dead for nearly a month.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, you could say she died around Shiyo 800, April 8.<PG>
Why was <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, who was supposed to have vanished in Motoki-cho, buried in the Arata graveyard?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nobody knows that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> had been buried in this land. That's a fact nothing can change.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\壺アップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the end, it was decided that <STYLE ID="3">my mom</STYLE>'s funeral would be held at the same time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I asked <STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> to let me see <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a terrible sight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the decomposing body covered in dirt was definitely <STYLE ID="3">my mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By Arata custom, the anniversary of <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s death was set not to the day she was found, but to the day she was thought to have died.<PG>
Ever since what happened on April 8, I'd been bracing myself for the possibility that <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So even with the grief, I was able to switch to feeling at least a little positive, glad that we'd found <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But another feeling welled up in me.<PG>
It had to be my fault that <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> met such a fate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I realized how weak I was, and how much I'd made <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> suffer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to break with my weak self, once and for all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> was gone now, but I wanted to be even a little strong.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"The mountain seclusion!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yeah, I'm thinking of starting right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, there's no need to be bound by that custom anymore."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"As long as I'm living here, I need the same strength as everyone else. I wanna retrain myself."</STYLE><PG>
She was against it at first, but my mind didn't change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'd lost <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> because of my own weakness, then I wanted to be even a little stronger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Otherwise, I'd never be able to face <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment I got to Arata, <STYLE ID="7">Grandma</STYLE> died and <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s body was found, so I still hadn't replied to the messages <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="17"> had sent</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I wanted to let the two of them know how things stood with me now, but
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I switched off my phone.<PG>
Now that I knew my own weakness, I was reluctant to face them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd get in touch with them once I'd become stronger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't want to drag them into anything more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my weakness dragged them into something again...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The anniversary of <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s death: Shiyo 800, April 8.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, please rest in peace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if she sinned and was cast into hell, I pray for <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s soul.<PG>
Come to think of it, I once heard something from <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't remember how the conversation got there, but we once talked about the afterlife.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">"A trillion years!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"1.6653 trillion years, to be exact. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">In Buddhist hell, even the sentence for the people with the lightest sins is this mind-boggling stretch of time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="18" RUBY="とうかつじごく">The Hell of Revival</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, it's called, and apparently it's where people who killed or tormented animals fall."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Th-then the place with the longest sentence is...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="あびじごく">The Avici Hell</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, or </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="むけんじごく">the Hell of Uninterrupted Torment</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, as they're called. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">For that sentence, you take a gigantic cube of stone 7 km on a side, and once every 100 years you brush it lightly with a thin cloth. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">You repeat that, and apparently it lasts even longer than it takes for the stone to wear away to nothing."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"That's so huge it doesn't even feel real..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"These things are meant as warnings, so maybe being a bit over the top made them easier for people back then to understand?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"If it's like that, the families of people who fell into hell have it rough. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">No matter how many memorial services they hold, the guy can't get out for trillions of years, right?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Actually, that's not the case. The family's prayers are really important!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"They are?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"How much the family prays for you is apparently an important measure in sentencing in the next world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">So even a wicked person bound for hell apparently gets their sins reduced if they're prayed for with all the family's heart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="21" RUBY="ついぜんくよう">Have you ever heard of merit-adding prayers</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yeah, I've heard of 'em."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Merit-adding: you add good deeds― </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">When the family prays in place of someone who fell into hell, good gets added to their account. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">So if you ever think, 'This person's probably going to hell,' I think if you pray hard for them, they'll be saved sooner."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Hmm... Well, it probably doesn't have anything to do with me, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">... when I die, will you say merit-adding prayers for me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Huh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> did something bad?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島頭を抱えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Apparently gluttony is a sin too, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> know that and you keep eating anyway? You're not sorry at all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Merit-adding prayers for someone like that would be a </STYLE><STYLE ID="22" RUBY="ぜいたく">luxury</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"That's so mean...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">　Oh, excuse meee! Two more ozoni, pleeease!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> should go to hell once and learn your lesson! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　And anyway, I'm gonna end up paying for that too, aren't I!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Buuut if I'm not getting merit-adding prayers, I figured I'd get plenty of offerings now, while I still can!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"I'll make proper offerings for you when you're dead, so give me a break for today!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\たき火.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "600" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\たき火.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―A silly memory like that draws a small smile out of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I keep praying hard, will <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> get out of hell sooner?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even now, she must be burning in hellfire hotter than this fire.<PG>
By rights I ought to be at the third-year memorial service too, but for now I'm on the mountain seclusion. I'll pray for <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s soul from here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
May <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, who pushed herself for my sake, committed murders she never wanted, and then died, find even a little peace.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Please, let my merit-adding prayers reach her.<PG>
Honestly, even now, it doesn't quite feel real that <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> is dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since that incident in Motoki-cho, my life has changed a lot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So much changed that I never had time to feel <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s death.<PG>
But cutting off contact with <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE> was my own choice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until the mountain seclusion is over, I won't contact <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> or <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must be my fault that <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> lost her parents too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People who get involved with me always meet with misfortune.<PG>
What must <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> and the others be thinking?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Are they worried? Are they angry?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, that's still okay.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Have they already forgotten me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I haven't forgotten them for a single day.<PG>
I want to see <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm continuing this mountain seclusion partly as a way of taking that <STYLE ID="23" RUBY="ぼんのう">worldly desire</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="24" RUBY="はら">purging</STYLE> it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Following the traditions of the Arata settlement, I <STYLE ID="25" RUBY="こっき">master myself</STYLE> and forge myself into something stronger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was part of the purpose too, but...<PG>
Even after 2 years, my mind still hasn't changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, part of me is eagerly waiting to turn 20.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once the mountain seclusion is over, I can see <STYLE ID="16">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The rule I set for myself had, if anything, been feeding my longing to see them.<PG>
In the end, my <STYLE ID="26" RUBY="こっきしん">self-discipline</STYLE> only amounted to this much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What have I been doing these 2 years?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've probably gotten stronger physically.<PG>
But inside―nothing has changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to hurry back to the easy life in the world down below.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Meanwhile, my spirit stays as immature as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still haven't trained enough.<PG>
―I let out a big sigh and pour water on the fire.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\火を消す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My eyes, used to the firelight, are swallowed by total darkness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But within 10 seconds, a sky full of stars slices through that darkness.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\星空.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It must be past midnight by now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So today's finally <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>'s third-year memorial service...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On Shiyo 802, April 8, the Arata settlement is supposed to hold a memorial service for <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I'm not going.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until the day I decided on, until April 30, I won't see anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until I turn 20, I...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>, have you been cast into hell after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, I will pray that your sins become even a little lighter, <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE>.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
